<title>USA: Canadian firm holds 7.5 pct Atlas Corp stake.</title>
<headline>Canadian firm holds 7.5 pct Atlas Corp stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Universal Canadian Resource Fund said Thursday it has acquired a 7.5 percent stake in Atlas Corp.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the Toronto-based firm said it bouight 1,498,200 shares of Atlas on September 19 at $0.6875 a share.</p>
<p>The firm said it holds the stake as an investment through Mackenzie Financial Corp, its investment adviser.</p>
</text>
